<title>CHINA: China Textile 1996 net surges 603.81 pct.</title>
<headline>China Textile 1996 net surges 603.81 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1995 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover	 287.794	  vs	  319.551</p>
<p> Net profit	 2.7153	 vs	    0.3858</p>
<p> Net asset per share    1.85   yuan   vs    1.84 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share     0.0084 yuan   vs    0.0012 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: China Textile Machinery Co Ltd</p>
<p>Note: the results were published in a company statement on Monday. The numbers are based on domestic accounting standards. Figures based on international accounting standards were not available.</p>
<p>The company's board of directors proposed a one-for-10 bonus issue based on its capital reserves, pending approval of a shareholders' meeting, the company statement said.</p>
</text>
